run-club-loop.mp3

One track, bundled in the app. The Home header's music toggle plays this
file and nothing else. No user uploads, no streaming: the loop ships with
the image, so playing it needs nothing beyond the page itself.

Composition and license
- The audio is an original instrumental generated for this app from a
  small synthesis script (procedural drums, bass, chords and lead at
  100 BPM in A minor). It is not a copy or cut of any existing song.
- Source: generated in-repo during the music-toggle change; the
  generator script and its parameters are documented in that change.
- License: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication) for the app's
  own distribution. Anyone who receives this file may play, remix and
  redistribute it freely with no attribution required.

Encoding
- 22.05 kHz joint stereo MP3, constant 48 kbps (LAME), 2:34 long,
  about 0.9 MB. Looping is handled by the audio element's `loop`
  attribute; the composition starts and ends on the same downbeat so
  the wrap sounds like the next bar of the same groove rather than a
  seam.
